The asset byte hashes in SHA256.json identify the local package snapshot.

Seven visual meshes and the joint description are copied unchanged.
The browser replaces stock wide fingertip meshes with custom narrow tips,
and adds an auxiliary two-joint thumb and a separate head chuck/spindle.
These additions are conceptual, not Robotiq products or approved accessories.
The animation shows the URDF parallel-link mimic motion, not independently
actuated human fingers. Rendering materials differ from source materials.
No assertion of manufacturer endorsement or bolt-bin performance validation.
